<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Kaatatuwaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Koyro Kaatatuwaa Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kaatatuwaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kat.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Koyro Kaatatuwaa Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Kaatatuwaa Mas'aafaa koyro shaakuu, Sammeela mas'aafatuwaa laa"atuwaan doometteedda, Israa'eeliyaa biittaa kaatetuwaa taarikiyaappe atteeddawaa kaalliide odee. Mas'aafaa heezzu waanna waanna kifiletuwaan shaakki s'eellanaw danddayeetto.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Solomone bare aawuwaa Daawita sa'aan Israa'eelanne Yihudaa kaatiyaa gidiyaawaanne Aa aawuwaa Daawita hayk'uwaabaa odee.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. K'ay ha mas'aafay Solomone kawutetsaa ek'uwaanne I ootseedda kiitaa odiyaa taarikiiyaa. I ootseedda oosotuwaappe odanaw doonaa kumiyaawe Yerusaalamen gimbbetteedda Geeshsha Golliyaa.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Israa'eelii huup'issanne gedissa kawutetsaa geetettiide laa"u kesiide shaaketteeddawaanne he shaaketteedda kawutetsatuwaa Kiristtoos yelettanaappe kase, udduppuntso s'eetu laytsay gakkanaw dumma dumma mooddeedda kaatetuwaa taarikiyaa odee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha laa"u mas'aafatuwan asaa kaaletsiyaa kaatii lo"anne iitanne geetettiide pirddettiyaawe, S'oossaw I ammanettiyaawaa keenaana. Hewaadankka k'ay he biittay dic'c'iyaa dichchaynne demmiyaa injjii he kaaletsiyaa kaatii S'oossaw ammanetteedawaa keenaana. Hara baggana k'ay allaga s'oossatoo goynneeddawenne azazettenan is's'eeddawe kaaletsiyaawanttakka kaalliyaa asaakka bashshaw afeedda. Huup'issa bagga kawutetsaa kaatetuu ubbaykka paac'iyaan kunddeeddino. Shin Yihudaa kaatetuwaa taarikii iitatuuwaakka lo"otuwaakka odee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kaatetuu mas'aafan koyro kifiliyaan daro eretteeddawanttu, S'oossaa doonaa gidiide timbbitiyaa k'aalaa odeeddanne Asay eek'aw goynnenna malanne S'oossaw azazettenan is's'enna mala, minisiide erisseedda timbbitiyaa odiyaa mino asatuwaa. Unttunttuppekka eretaa dariyaawe Eelaasa. Eelaasi Ba'aala k'eesetuwaana naasetteedda taarikiikka he sa'aan odetteedda (Shemppuwaa 18 s'eella).</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Daawitaa Wodiyaa Wurssetsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 1:1-2:12">1:1—2:12</ref></char></para>
